<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Citizens Banking raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Citizens Banking raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald and Co said analyst Fred Cummings upgraded Citizens Banking Corp to buy from hold with a 12-month price target of $42.</p>
<p>-- cited an &quot;upbeat&quot; marketing trip by analyst with management.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Citizens is now focused more sharply on improving profitability through active capital management,&quot; Cummings said in a report.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/2 to 36.</p>
</text>
